“Dark Cloud Chronicle”

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C18_YIN_YUN_CHRONICLES_DESC]
An ancient book, recording a rare history of Kirins: the rise and fall of a rare marine civilization. The decline of civilization caused by strange celestial phenomena is indeed a pity and a conversation topic for the Kirins.

